<http://data.silknow.org/object/b9910425-cb49-39c0-96e5-24a1079a4f80/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Textile panel of brocaded silk tapestry-woven in coloured silks and gilt paper thread. Divided into two compartments. In the upper and smaller compartment has scholar's scrolls woven on a yellow ground. In the lower compartment are pomegranate trees, stems of bamboo and magnolia growing from rocks on a bank beside a river woven on a cream-coloured ground. Each compartment is frames in black satin and edged with white satin."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/b9910425-cb49-39c0-96e5-24a1079a4f80> .

